sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Constructor UI
  participant G as Core Admin API
  participant P as Plugin instance
  C->>G: GET admin/surface
  G->>G: authorize instance + admin.surface.get
  G->>P: capability admin.surface.get
  P-->>G: declarative AdminSurface
  G->>G: validate, cache digest, redact
  G-->>C: schema + digest
  C->>G: POST page query/action + digest
  G->>G: permission, input validation, limit, audit
  G->>P: declared capability + limited input
  P-->>G: typed result/error
  G-->>C: typed data or Problem Details
